# BOOM and Allegro freeze

- Source URL: https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/ao486_MiSTer/issues/128

Tested in working DOS 6.22 and FreeDOS environments. All versions of BOOM and Allegro (ASETUP, the setup EXE) freeze when I try to run them. It locks at a blinking cursor, I've waited for 10 minutes or so.

(DOOM and DOOM2 all work in FreeDOS just fine.)

This is the version that comes packaged with other versions of FreeDOS, plus I have tried the classic version of BOOM available online.

